scope one keystone -- the Glow desk run contract's arity, made askable and then compared across all three files that state it
status GREEN -- glow_desk_arity, glow_desk_run and glow_desk_reach all proven on metal after the worker refactor; index_row_bound closed; readme_metrics regenerated in this lap's own commit
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the worker demands an exact sample count while the emitted program demands a floor and ignores the rest. Whether that second shape wants a gate is a language custody question, and the fence otherwise stands.
